#AspenCSV0.4
#ADC1,ADC2,ADC3,ADC4: data lines are exactly one sample interval (C line) apart; the line after each T line is absolute, the rest are deltas
#T,tcxoSec,utcSec,sync: time of the next data line (center of the ADC filter window); sync 0=no GPS time yet (utcSec blank), 1=GPS locked, 2=GPS holdover
#Trailing channels of a delta line with zero change (or gain 0) are omitted; first enabled channel is always present
#G,msPPS,msLag,yr,mo,day,hr,min,sec,lat,lon,z,HDOP,num_sats,age_ms
#H,ms,batt,V,mA,tempC,RH,Vcc,maxSampleDiff_ms,maxReadTime_us,maxWriteTime_us,maxDrainTime_us,drainDiff_ms,gpsOn,sync,timeErr_us,tcxo_ppm,adc_ppm,maxRetimeTime_us
